# ── Compiled binaries — source is the truth, never commit build outputs ──
# Extensionless ELF executables built in-tree from adjacent sources.
# (Keep files that carry an extension: .cpp/.h/.sh/.md/CMakeLists.txt/etc.)
tools/*
!tools/*.*
!tools/*/
